1020
01:22:26.875 --> 01:22:27.875
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Manny...</font></b>

1021
01:22:29.625 --> 01:22:31.583
<b><font color="#FFFF00">why are you saying that?</font></b>

1022
01:22:31.792 --> 01:22:35.125
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Of course.
I'm going to miss you loads.</font></b>

1023
01:22:43.375 --> 01:22:46.792
<b><font color="#00FFFF"><i>Slowly and steadily
Manny's health was deteriorating.</i></font></b>

1024
01:22:47.917 --> 01:22:51.917
<b><font color="#00FFFF"><i>We neither had anything to say
to each other, nor to hear.</i></font></b>

1025
01:22:55.667 --> 01:22:57.500
<b><font color="#00FFFF"><i>And I was helpless.</i></font></b>

1026
01:23:03.917 --> 01:23:07.333
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Manny...
Manny, get up.</font></b>

1027
01:23:07.833 --> 01:23:09.250
<b><font color="#FFFF00">- Kizie?
- Get up.</font></b>

1028
01:23:10.000 --> 01:23:11.000
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Get up.</font></b>

1029
01:23:11.750 --> 01:23:12.583
<b><font color="#FFFF00">What happened?</font></b>

1030
01:23:12.667 --> 01:23:14.958
<b><font color="#FFFF00">- You're a phony.
- What?</font></b>

1031
01:23:15.125 --> 01:23:17.708
<b><font color="#FFFF00">You promised to make me a heroine.</font></b>

1032
01:23:18.292 --> 01:23:20.250
<b><font color="#FFFF00">- Did you forget?
- No.</font></b>

1033
01:23:20.875 --> 01:23:23.250
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Who will complete JP's film?</font></b>

1034
01:23:24.167 --> 01:23:25.375
<b><font color="#FFFF00">I will, of course.</font></b>

1035
01:23:25.542 --> 01:23:26.625
<b><font color="#FFFF00">So?</font></b>

1036
01:23:27.833 --> 01:23:28.917
