1037
01:23:29.208 --> 01:23:31.667
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Seize the day, Immanuel.</font></b>

1038
01:23:33.708 --> 01:23:35.917
<b><font color="#FFFF00">It's now or never.</font></b>

1039
01:23:37.000 --> 01:23:39.458
<b><font color="#FFFF00">The heroine must compromise.</font></b>

1040
01:23:40.417 --> 01:23:41.500
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Okay.</font></b>

1041
01:23:43.167 --> 01:23:44.250
