1051
01:25:59.125 --> 01:26:00.875
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Manny, it's infected.</font></b>

1052
01:26:01.167 --> 01:26:03.059
<b><font color="#FFFF00">- I'll have to call someone.
- No, please. Kizie, no!</font></b>

1053
01:26:03.083 --> 01:26:04.958
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Don't call them.
Please don't call them.</font></b>

1054
01:26:05.458 --> 01:26:07.583
<b><font color="#FFFF00">- Manny!
