1078
01:28:09.958 --> 01:28:11.333
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Mr Rajkumar.</font></b>

1079
01:28:11.917 --> 01:28:13.042
<b><font color="#00FFFF"><i>Ms Basu.</i></font></b>

1080
01:28:13.500 --> 01:28:18.000
<b><font color="#00FFFF"><i>I told you that when I die,
