1081
01:28:18.375 --> 01:28:19.708
<b><font color="#00FFFF"><i>Have you written anything?</i></font></b>

1082
01:28:21.375 --> 01:28:22.375
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Yes.</font></b>

1083
01:28:22.583 --> 01:28:23.833
